Fable 5:
- slow as hell;
- an incremental upgrade of Opus 4.8 - does not justify the 2x price, for sure;
- cares about instructions in the prompt (that's an improvement), but doesn't care about rules at all (even less than Opus 4.8).

It's awesome to see the progress, anyway.

@PositivFuturist We need a public website, database / API  of these crimes so that they can be tracked and shared with nutjobs like Polanski. 

Along with boat numbers, broken down by gender and country of origin.

Put Claude Fable 5 to good use 😀

@AnthropicAI I applied! Would love to work in the Arts/Humanities/Research sectors. I have always struggled to afford formal education; this would mean the world to me.

